---
/**
 * Maida Vale, 17 November 2026. A draft for Kaspar to read on the review link
 * (F2F ops clients/structure-and-style/areas-review); held noindex by
 * areaMaidaValeCheck until he has read it and his changes are in. Nothing
 * goes live before he has approved every area page (Denis, 15 Nov 2026).
 *
 * ON THE PRIMROSE HILL MODEL from the start (a founder's go, 17 Nov: "Yes,
 * Maida Vale"; Denis, 15 Nov: "use the same design and structure for the
 * next articles"; ops README, "The structure rule, applied"; ops
 * SS_AREA_PAGE_RULES_v1.0.md, a draft, read for its plan items): address
