 * is new copy for him to check.
 *
 * Street and building names are Westminster's, Historic England's and the
 * published history's, describing the homes. None is a place we claim to have
 * worked. No review names Maida Vale.
 *
 * FAQ sources, all three new, none on another area page: "Is built-in
 * shelving a good idea?" (Google People also ask, built in bookcase: "Are
